    "声音与振动也可在键盘左上角快速调整，静音时不播放按键声。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sounds and haptics can also be changed from the keyboard's top-left menu. Key sounds don't play in silent mode."
